RustDesk is an open source remote desktop application: control other
computers or let others control yours, through the public RustDesk
servers or a self-hosted server.

This port uses a native egui user interface, because the upstream
Sciter and Flutter interfaces are not available on FreeBSD. It provides
the main window (own ID and password, connecting to peers, server
settings), the remote desktop window and the connection manager for
incoming connections.
